# size: 1200x820
# Initial, populated, selected, loading and read-only states. The preview field
# is the example's read-only control, and navigation is what makes Back, Up and
# the breadcrumbs meaningful; all three are enable/disable rules a screenshot
# of the first frame cannot check.
expect-disabled Back
expect-disabled Up
expect-disabled "Preview text"
expect-disabled #text-preview
expect-count entry: 6
snapshot initial
click docs
wait 700
expect-enabled Back
expect-enabled Up
snapshot inside-docs
click Back
wait 700
expect-disabled Back
expect-count entry: 6
click README.md
wait 700
expect-selected #entry:README.md
expect-enabled "Preview text"
snapshot file-selected
click "Preview text"
wait 900
expect-disabled #text-preview
snapshot previewed
